{"study_accession":"PRJNA1305497","secondary_study_accession":"SRP608758","title":"Single cell sequencing time course of MK differentiation under perturbation","description":"HSPCs were differentiated in the presence of test compounds. On days 1, 2, 5, and 7 of differentiation, samples were multiplexed (hashed) with cell multiplexing oligos (CMOs, 10X Genomics) according to manufacturer's protocol. Briefly, cells were washed with Cell Staining Buffer (Biolegend), counted, and incubated with CMOs for 5 min at room temperature. After incubation, cells were washed with 4 percent HSA (Grifols) three times. Libraries containing 12 samples each tagged with individual CMOs were pooled by combining approximately 100k cells from each well. Libraries were washed once in 4 percent HSA and counted, then resuspended in CSB at 1.2 million cells/mL. Each test compound was sequenced in duplicate, where duplicates were spread across libraries.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":18,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN50606847","study_accession":"PRJNA1305497","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Day 0_Lib 1","description":"Day 0_Lib 1","sex":"not provided","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2026-09-04","attributes":[["isolate","not applicable"],["age","not provided"],["biomaterial_provider","not provided"],["collection_date","not provided"],["geo_loc_name","not provided"],["sex","not provided"],["tissue","not applicable"],["cell_line","not applicable"],["cell_type","peripheral blood CD34+ cells"],["cell_subtype","not applicable"],["culture_collection","not applicable"],["dev_stage","not applicable"],["disease","not applicable"],["disease_stage","not applicable"],["ethnicity","not provided"],["health_state","not applicable"],["karyotype","not provided"],["phenotype","not applicable"],["population","not provided"],["race","not provided"],["sample_type","single cell"],["treatment","not provided"],["description","hashed libra